    <x:String x:Key="Host_CreateConfirm">Create and download</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_ProblemNoBuilds">There is no build yet. Make one on the Builds tab - the server takes its game version from it.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_ProblemNoVersion">This build names no game version. Pick one in the build's settings, or take another build.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_ProblemLoader">The launcher cannot set up a {0} server yet. Builds without a loader and Fabric, Forge and NeoForge builds work.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_ProblemInstaller">The {0} installer did not finish: {1}. What it has already downloaded is kept - try again.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_ProblemUnknownVersion">Mojang does not list version {0}, so there is no server to get for it.</x:String>
