    <x:String x:Key="Host_Settings">Memory and port</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_SettingsPort">Port</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_SettingsHint">Changed while the server is stopped; used from the next start.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_OpenFolder">Open the server's folder</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_Remove">Take off the list</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_RemoveHint">The server leaves the launcher, but nothing is deleted: its folder, world included, moves to servers/.removed. A running server cannot be taken off.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_PortChip">port {0}</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_MemoryChip">{0} of memory</x:String>
