    <x:String x:Key="Host_CommandNoServer">The server is not running - there is nobody to carry the command out</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_Whitelist">Who may join</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Host_WhitelistHint">Only players on this list can join. A nickname is written exactly as in the friend's launcher: capital and small letters differ. A nickname is not a password: the server lets in whoever joins under a listed one, so give the address only to people you trust.</x:String>
